        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "Expose legacy cron store doctor lint findings",
        "body": "## Summary\n- add default-disabled `core/doctor/legacy-cron-store` structured lint findings for legacy cron JSON stores, legacy run logs, quarantined rows, SQLite projection backfills, notify fallback, and stale dreaming payloads\n- keep real mutation in the existing legacy `doctor --fix` cron repair path\n- wire the new check into the ordered `doctor:legacy-cron` contribution next to the existing WhatsApp crontab check\n\n## Public surface\n- No public SDK/plugin/config contract changes.\n- Default `doctor --lint` is unchanged; this runs with `--only core/doctor/legacy-cron-store` or `--all`.\n\n## Validation\n- `node scripts/run-vitest.mjs src/commands/doctor/cron/index.test.ts src/flows/doctor-health-contributions.test.ts` (113 tests)\n- `pnpm exec oxfmt --check src/commands/doctor/cron/index.ts src/commands/doctor/cron/index.test.ts src/flows/doctor-core-checks.ts src/flows/doctor-health-contributions.ts src/flows/doctor-health-contributions.test.ts`\n- `pnpm exec oxlint src/commands/doctor/cron/index.ts src/commands/doctor/cron/index.test.ts src/flows/doctor-core-checks.ts src/flows/doctor-health-contributions.ts src/flows/doctor-health-contributions.test.ts`\n- `node scripts/plugin-sdk-surface-report.mjs --check`\n- `git diff --check`\n\n## Not completed locally\n- `pnpm tsgo:core`, `pnpm tsgo:core:test`, and `pnpm tsgo:test:src` timed out on Windows after 5 minutes without diagnostics.\n- Source CLI proof using throwaway `--profile doctor-cron-proof-*` timed out because each invocation rebuilt the dirty-tree runtime; generated proof profiles were removed.",
